<title>USA: Quickresponse to buy back $5 mln of stock.</title>
<headline>Quickresponse to buy back $5 mln of stock.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>QuickResponse Services Inc Tuesday said its board of directors authorized the repurchase from time to time of up to $5 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>On April 4, the company had 8,417,345 shares of common stock outstanding. The company said it may discontinue purchases of its Common Stock at any time that management determines additional purchases are not warranted.</p>
</text>
